      "side": 1,
      "message": "Both the cases. If we\u0027re connected to a network and we suddenly reboot. we don\u0027t want wpa_supplicant to start connecting to the previously configured network before QNS kicks in.\n\nSo, remove all networks on turning wifi off (exiting ConnectMode) \u0026 reboot (entering ConnectMode).",
